{"ref":"BDB, אֲחִילוּד","hw":"אֲחִילוּד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִילוּד</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>according to Thes = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִי יְלוּד</span> <em>child’s brother</em> (?)<strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  father of Jehoshaphat, David’s chronicler <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.16\">2 S 8:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:24\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.24\">20:24</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.3\">1 K 4:3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.15\">1 Ch 18:15</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  father of Baana, officer of Solomon <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.12\">1 K 4:12</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲחִימוֹת","prev":"BDB, אֲחִיטוּב"}